theirs. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by any of them or their authors. "GATK" and "Picard" are
trademarks of the Broad Institute, Inc.; they are used here only to name the tools whose output varcall-rs
reproduces.

bwa-mem2 2.2.1 (align-rs: the `mem` algorithm, kseq / kbtree / ksort from klib, ksw)
  Copyright (C) 2019 Intel Corporation, Heng Li. MIT License.
  https://github.com/bwa-mem2/bwa-mem2

GATK 4.7 (variant-rs: HaplotypeCaller, Mutect2 and the other tools listed in docs/reference.md; numeric tables in
variant-rs/tables and variant-rs/crates/*/src/*.bin were generated by running GATK code; VCF header lines are
taken from GATK's output)
  Copyright Broad Institute, Inc. Apache License, Version 2.0.
  https://github.com/broadinstitute/gatk

Picard 3.5 (variant-rs: MarkDuplicates, SortSam, GatherBamFiles, MergeVcfs)
  Copyright Broad Institute, Inc. MIT License.
  https://github.com/broadinstitute/picard

htsjdk 5.0 (variant-rs: BAM / VCF encoding, header merging, sorting and merging iterators)
  Copyright The Broad Institute and contributors. MIT License.
  https://github.com/samtools/htsjdk

